          "title": "A Decap dance organ on tour with Guido Belcanto",
          "intro": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "In 2008 Flemish singer Guido Belcanto took a Decap dance organ on stage in his theatre show Balzaal der Gebroken Harten. We built it from scratch for him: the Belcanto organ. It toured the largest halls of Belgium's cultural centres, next to a singer.",
