        "primary": {
          "eyebrow": "Why it worked",
          "title": "Sensitivity and volume under control",
          "body": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A dance organ is voiced to fill a dance hall. A theatre stage, with a singer at the microphone, asks for something else.",
              "spans": []
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "On a Decap organ, sensitivity and volume are controllable. That made it possible to set the organ for each hall and play it alongside a singer, night after night, in the largest cultural centres in Belgium.",
              "spans": []
            }
